  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yangbearblog/images/main/kumaittanmomen.gif\" alt=\"kumaittanmomen\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://yangbear.bearblog.dev/hyakka-ryouran/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">妖怪集章</a>系列還沒束了。<a href=\"https://yangbear.bearblog.dev/kumakokuin/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">首頁</a>裡面有一項是要註明自己最喜歡的妖怪，所以就畫了這個以前看鬼太郎時最喜歡的可愛角色<a href=\"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%8D%E6%9C%A8%E7%B6%BF_%28%E3%82%B2%E3%82%B2%E3%82%B2%E3%81%AE%E9%AC%BC%E5%A4%AA%E9%83%8E%29\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">一反木綿</a>。</p>\n<p>「<a href=\"https://sewingschool.hapimade.com/tan/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">一反</a>」是布料的單位，就是一件衣服份量的布料長度，真是一個隨便的單位。</p>",
